From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:52:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/22] iommu/qcom: Keep Venus page-table cleanup independent
 of runtime PM

Allow offline PTE removal and domain release without waking the wrapper.
Serialize Linux-owned context state with clock gating and require a full
ASID invalidation before publishing the resumed bank. Keep the domain
owner and IRQ lifetime independent of the consumer fwspec.

A whole-TLB flush issues ASID invalidation. Gather sync only waits for
completion of an invalidation already issued.

Signed-off-by: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
---
